How to attribute
----------------

When you use the data, credit it like this:

    Data: Hybrasil Star and Exoplanet Dataset by Cade Summers, CC BY-SA 4.0,
    https://hybrasil.app

Once a dataset DOI has been minted, use it in place of the URL. CITATION.cff
gives the full citation for both the software and the dataset.

When you share an adapted version of the dataset, CC BY-SA 4.0 requires you to
release it under the same licence and to say that you changed it. When you run
a modified version of the software as a network service, AGPL-3.0 requires you
to offer its users the modified source.
